    "A single figure for how much of **this Mac's capacity** a group of processes uses — an even blend of two shares:" : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine einzelne Zahl dafür, wie viel der **Kapazität dieses Mac** eine Gruppe von Prozessen nutzt, als gleichgewichtete Mischung aus zwei Anteilen:"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A single figure for how much of **this Mac's capacity** a group of processes uses — an even blend of two shares:"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un chiffre unique indiquant quelle part de **la capacité de ce Mac** un groupe de processus utilise, en mélange à parts égales de deux proportions :"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
