    "At the same die temperature, the fans now run about %1$@%% faster than %2$@ weeks ago. Dust buildup in the vents is the usual cause; cleaning them usually brings speeds back down." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bei gleicher Chiptemperatur laufen die Lüfter jetzt etwa %1$@%% schneller als vor %2$@ Wochen. Meist ist Staub in den Lüftungsschlitzen die Ursache; nach dem Reinigen sinkt die Drehzahl in der Regel wieder."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At the same die temperature, the fans now run about %1$@%% faster than %2$@ weeks ago. Dust buildup in the vents is the usual cause; cleaning them usually brings speeds back down."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "À température de puce égale, les ventilateurs tournent maintenant environ %1$@%% plus vite qu'il y a %2$@ semaines. L'accumulation de poussière dans les ouvertures d'aération en est la cause habituelle ; les nettoyer ramène généralement la vitesse à la normale."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在相同芯片温度下，风扇转速比 %2$@ 周前快了约 %1$@%%。通常是出风口积灰导致的，清理之后转速一般会降回去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At warning level" : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
