    "Memory is climbing steadily (~{memory.leakSlopePerMin|bytes}/min, {memory.leakConfidence|pct} confident over {process.uptime}) — a consistent upward trend, the signature of a leak." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Speicher steigt stetig an (ca. {memory.leakSlopePerMin|bytes}/Min., {memory.leakConfidence|pct} Konfidenz über {process.uptime}): ein gleichmäßiger Aufwärtstrend, das typische Zeichen eines Lecks."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Memory is climbing steadily (~{memory.leakSlopePerMin|bytes}/min, {memory.leakConfidence|pct} confident over {process.uptime}) — a consistent upward trend, the signature of a leak."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La mémoire augmente régulièrement (environ {memory.leakSlopePerMin|bytes}/min, confiance de {memory.leakConfidence|pct} sur {process.uptime}) : une tendance constante à la hausse, la signature d'une fuite."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内存在稳定攀升（约 {memory.leakSlopePerMin|bytes}/分钟，在 {process.uptime} 内置信度 {memory.leakConfidence|pct}）。持续上升的趋势正是内存泄漏的特征。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Memory is comfortable. Cached files are reclaimable and nothing to worry about." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
