    "These settings need about %@, more than your %@ size limit. The oldest high-resolution samples will be dropped early to fit: raise the size limit or reduce resolution to keep it all." : {
      "comment" : "SettingsView",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Einstellungen benötigen etwa %@, mehr als dein Größenlimit von %@. Die ältesten hochauflösenden Samples werden vorzeitig verworfen, damit es passt: Erhöhe das Größenlimit oder verringere die Auflösung, um alles zu behalten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These settings need about %@, more than your %@ size limit. The oldest high-resolution samples will be dropped early to fit: raise the size limit or reduce resolution to keep it all."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ces réglages nécessitent environ %@, plus que votre limite de taille de %@. Les échantillons haute résolution les plus anciens seront supprimés plus tôt pour tenir : augmentez la limite de taille ou réduisez la résolution pour tout conserver."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些设置需要约 %@，超过了您的 %@ 大小上限。最旧的高分辨率样本将被提前丢弃以适应上限：提高大小上限或降低分辨率以保留全部。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac" : {
      "comment" : "Hardware View & Overview",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Mac"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This Mac"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce Mac"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于本机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac has no internal battery, so charge, health and runtime don't apply. System power is the whole machine's measured draw; the energy impact above ranks which apps are working it hardest." : {
      "comment" : "Battery & Energy View",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Mac hat keine interne Batterie, daher gelten Ladung, Zustand und Laufzeit hier nicht. Systemleistung ist die gemessene Leistungsaufnahme des gesamten Geräts; der Energieverbrauch oben zeigt, welche Apps es am stärksten fordern."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This Mac has no internal battery, so charge, health and runtime don't apply. System power is the whole machine's measured draw; the energy impact above ranks which apps are working it hardest."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce Mac n'a pas de batterie interne, donc la charge, l'état et l'autonomie ne s'appliquent pas. La puissance système est la consommation mesurée de toute la machine ; l'impact énergétique ci-dessus classe les apps qui la sollicitent le plus."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 Mac 没有内置电池，因此电量、健康度和运行时间不适用。系统功耗是整台机器的测量功耗；上方的能耗影响列出了哪些应用消耗最多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This item lives in the cloud and takes no local space until downloaded." : {
      "comment" : "Disk Map (1.6.0)",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Objekt liegt in der Cloud und belegt keinen lokalen Speicherplatz, bis es geladen wird."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This item lives in the cloud and takes no local space until downloaded."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cet élément se trouve dans le cloud et n'occupe aucun espace local tant qu'il n'est pas téléchargé."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此项目位于云端，下载前不占用本地空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This language was translated by %@, an AI model, and has not yet been reviewed by native speakers. Corrections are welcome at crowdin.com/project/mac-performance-monitor." : {
      "comment" : "SettingsView: notice under the language picker for AI-generated languages; %@ is the model name",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Sprache wurde von %@, einem KI-Modell, übersetzt und noch nicht von Muttersprachlern geprüft. Korrekturen sind willkommen unter crowdin.com/project/mac-performance-monitor."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This language was translated by %@, an AI model, and has not yet been reviewed by native speakers. Corrections are welcome at crowdin.com/project/mac-performance-monitor."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cette langue a été traduite par %@, un modèle d'IA, et n'a pas encore été relue par des locuteurs natifs. Vos corrections sont bienvenues sur crowdin.com/project/mac-performance-monitor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此语言由 %@（一个 AI 模型）翻译，尚未经母语者审校。欢迎在 crowdin.com/project/mac-performance-monitor 提交修正。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This locally administered MAC address does not contain an IEEE vendor ID." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese lokal verwaltete MAC-Adresse enthält keine IEEE-Herstellerkennung."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This locally administered MAC address does not contain an IEEE vendor ID."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cette adresse MAC administrée localement ne contient pas d'ID de fabricant IEEE."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是本地管理的 MAC 地址，不含 IEEE 厂商标识。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This process grew %1$@ over %2$d min (~%3$@/s, %4$d%% confidence). If it keeps climbing, consider restarting it." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Prozess ist in %2$d Min. um %1$@ gewachsen (~%3$@/s, %4$d %% Konfidenz). Wenn er weiter wächst, solltest du einen Neustart erwägen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This process grew %1$@ over %2$d min (~%3$@/s, %4$d%% confidence). If it keeps climbing, consider restarting it."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce processus a grossi de %1$@ en %2$d min (~%3$@/s, confiance de %4$d %%). S'il continue de grimper, envisagez de le redémarrer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该进程在 %2$d 分钟内增长了 %1$@（约 %3$@/秒，置信度 %4$d%%）。如果还在持续攀升，可以考虑重启它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This process has exited. Showing its last logged history." : {
      "comment" : "Metric Cards & Explanations",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Prozess wurde beendet. Angezeigt wird sein zuletzt aufgezeichneter Verlauf."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This process has exited. Showing its last logged history."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce processus s'est terminé. Affichage de son dernier historique enregistré."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此进程已退出。显示其最后记录的历史数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This process has no open file descriptors right now." : {
      "comment" : "Memory Inspector & Open Files",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Prozess hat gerade keine offenen Dateideskriptoren."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This process has no open file descriptors right now."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce processus n'a aucun descripteur de fichier ouvert pour le moment."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该进程当前没有打开的文件描述符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This sends SIGKILL (kill -9). The process stops at once without saving, so any unsaved work is lost." : {
      "comment" : "Identity entries: English renders the key verbatim. Present so the two tables mirror each other and English copy stays auditable in one place; check-localization.py enforces the parity.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dies sendet SIGKILL (kill -9). Der Prozess stoppt sofort, ohne zu sichern, ungesicherte Arbeit geht also verloren."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This sends SIGKILL (kill -9). The process stops at once without saving, so any unsaved work is lost."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ceci envoie SIGKILL (kill -9). Le processus s'arrête immédiatement sans enregistrer, donc tout travail non enregistré est perdu."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这会发送 SIGKILL（kill -9）。进程立即停止，不会保存，任何未保存的工作都会丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
